Build a premium birthday tribute website with the same structure, design language, interactions, and animation behavior described below. The result must feel polished, emotional, musical, devotional, elegant, and alive, while staying usable and professional on mobile and desktop.

PROJECT TYPE
Create a single-page birthday tribute website with optional account/login pages and API/database-backed wishes. The main page must include:
- Floating glass navbar
- Animated hero with live birthday tracker
- Gallery section with zoom/lightbox
- Songs playlist section with embedded YouTube player and favorite stars
- About/journey section with carousel cards
- Wishes and good-deed memory form
- Special letter modal with voice reader
- Gift status section
- Animated garden/footer
- Floating chatbot/guide
- Back-to-top button

VISUAL STYLE
Use a soft premium nature-and-devotion visual style. The design should feel like a warm fan tribute, not a corporate landing page.

Core palette:
- Deep teal/navy: #08243a, #0d3b57
- Peacock teal: #0f6b78
- Fresh green: #1f8c68
- Golden saffron: #d88a18
- Soft gold: #ffe0a3, #ffd84b
- Cream background: #f3fbf7
- Mist green: #d7f1e7
- Ink text: #0b2330
- Muted text: #49636a
- White glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.62 to 0.9)

Typography:
- Display headings: Playfair Display, Georgia, serif
- Body/UI: Plus Jakarta Sans, Arial, sans-serif
- Use strong hierarchy. Hero h1 must be large and elegant. Cards and panels must use compact professional type.
- Letter spacing must be 0. Do not use negative letter spacing.

Shape language:
- Border radius should be 8px for most UI.
- Use glass panels with subtle borders, shadows, and blur.
- Avoid oversized pill buttons except where necessary.
- Avoid one-color monotone styling. Use teal, cream, green, gold, and navy together.

Global background:
- Body background should be cream/mint with subtle radial gradients and a faint grid pattern.
- Add fixed ambient leaf particles drifting across the page.
- Page content must sit above the ambient field using z-index layering.

