IMPLEMENTATION NOTES
- If using Next.js, main page may render static HTML body through a client wrapper, but all scripts must initialize after injection. If document is already loaded, call init immediately; otherwise listen to DOMContentLoaded.
- Keep direct static file and served React version in sync if both exist.
- Store public assets under /public so image/audio/video paths resolve from the website root.
- Do not commit node_modules, .next, local logs, or local data JSON.
- For deployment, replace local JSON databases with a persistent hosted database.

